<h3 id="section-23">6.3 靠轴线的“负半径虚拟点”如何理解</h3>
<p>本文采用位于 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\geq0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≥</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span> 区域的非退化 T3 网格，因此母单元面积 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_e&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>、中心半径 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{ec}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">ec</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>，光滑域实际旋转体积 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_k&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>。预计算 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">B</span></span></span></span> 及其梯度时，分母来自这些真实几何量。虚拟点的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">B</span></span></span></span> 直接按<a href="#section-21">第 6.1 节</a>的四个公式组合，无须在虚拟点坐标处重新求型函数。即使示意图上出现 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_k-\ell_k&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">ℓ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>，这个示意半径也不进入 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_I/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.07847em;">I</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span></span></span></span> 求值或积分权重；内力计算使用组合后的矩阵和正权重 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_k/4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">/4</span></span></span></span>。</p>
<p><strong>注意：</strong> 虚拟点矩阵按<a href="#section-21">第 6.1 节</a>直接组合。不要在负半径处重新求型函数，也不能将示意半径取绝对值后用于求值或积分。</p>
<h2 id="section-24">7. 温度应变，以及压力、温度梯度如何处理</h2>
<h3 id="section-25">7.1 保留 SNS 的四点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span></span> 矩阵</h3>
<p>本文用 SNS 虚拟点矩阵计算渗流和热传导。为区分不同的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span></span>，本文记原始 T3 型函数梯度为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}_e=\nabla \mathbf{N}_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，常数 NS 矩阵为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{\mathbf{E}}_k^V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.3643em;vertical-align:-0.247em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord overline"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8861em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.8061em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1173em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.339em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，SNS 虚拟点矩阵为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\mathbf{E}}_{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.9461em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width:calc(100% - 0.1667em);margin-left:0.1667em;top:-3.6861em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span style="height:0.26em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.26em" viewBox="0 0 600 260" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M200 55.538c-77 0-168 73.953-177 73.953-3 0-7
-2.175-9-5.437L2 97c-1-2-2-4-2-6 0-4 2-7 5-9l20-12C116 12 171 0 207 0c86 0
 114 68 191 68 78 0 168-68 177-68 4 0 7 2 9 5l12 19c1 2.175 2 4.35 2 6.525 0
 4.35-2 7.613-5 9.788l-19 13.05c-92 63.077-116.937 75.308-183 76.128
-68.267.847-113-73.952-191-73.952z"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；其中 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k,g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span></span></span></span> 分别标明光滑域和虚拟点。四点矩阵由平均 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span></span> 加减相应方向的梯度项得到。</p>
<p>热传导使用四点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\mathbf{E}}_{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.9461em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width:calc(100% - 0.1667em);margin-left:0.1667em;top:-3.6861em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span style="height:0.26em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.26em" viewBox="0 0 600 260" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M200 55.538c-77 0-168 73.953-177 73.953-3 0-7
-2.175-9-5.437L2 97c-1-2-2-4-2-6 0-4 2-7 5-9l20-12C116 12 171 0 207 0c86 0
 114 68 191 68 78 0 168-68 177-68 4 0 7 2 9 5l12 19c1 2.175 2 4.35 2 6.525 0
 4.35-2 7.613-5 9.788l-19 13.05c-92 63.077-116.937 75.308-183 76.128
-68.267.847-113-73.952-191-73.952z"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，热容量使用原始 T3 型函数。关闭热对流时，温度方程不依赖 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">u</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol u,p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol">u</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span>；开启后，仍用四点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\mathbf{E}}_{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.9461em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width:calc(100% - 0.1667em);margin-left:0.1667em;top:-3.6861em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span style="height:0.26em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.26em" viewBox="0 0 600 260" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M200 55.538c-77 0-168 73.953-177 73.953-3 0-7
-2.175-9-5.437L2 97c-1-2-2-4-2-6 0-4 2-7 5-9l20-12C116 12 171 0 207 0c86 0
 114 68 191 68 78 0 168-68 177-68 4 0 7 2 9 5l12 19c1 2.175 2 4.35 2 6.525 0
 4.35-2 7.613-5 9.788l-19 13.05c-92 63.077-116.937 75.308-183 76.128
-68.267.847-113-73.952-191-73.952z"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算 Darcy 速度和温度梯度，新增项见<a href="#section-35">第 8.5 节</a>。温度方程不额外加入 PPP 项，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span></span> 中的 SNS 梯度项保留。节点光滑在瞬态导热中也可能出现积分不足造成的数值问题，保留这些梯度项有依据，见 <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijthermalsci.2016.06.027" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cui 等关于稳态与瞬态导热的研究</a>。</p>
<h3 id="section-26">7.2 体积平均的温度与其梯度</h3>
<p>采用前面的体积方案，统一定义</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">N</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∋</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∋</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi>V</mi><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{aligned}
\overline{\mathbf{N}}_k^V&amp;=\frac{1}{V_k}\operatorname*{Assemble}_{e\ni k}\left[\int_{D_{ke}}\mathbf{N}_e\,\mathrm{d}V\right],\\
\overline{\mathbf{E}}_k^V&amp;=\frac{1}{V_k}\operatorname*{Assemble}_{e\ni k}\left[\int_{D_{ke}}\nabla \mathbf{N}_e\,\mathrm{d}V\right].
\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:5.5356em;vertical-align:-2.5178em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:3.0178em;"><span style="top:-5.0178em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.45em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord overline"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8861em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">N</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.8061em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1173em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.339em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-2.25em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.45em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord overline"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8861em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><