ght:0.3831em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p>第 3、4 点分别减去、加上轴向项 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold">G</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_k\mathbf{G}_{E,z,k}^{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2605em;vertical-align:-0.4192em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">ℓ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413em;"><span style="top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.04398em;">z</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.4192em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold">G</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></msubsup><mo separator="true">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold">G</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{G}_{E,r,k}^{V},\mathbf{G}_{E,z,k}^{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2605em;vertical-align:-0.4192em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413em;"><span style="top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.4192em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413em;"><span style="top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.04398em;">z</span><span class="mpunct mtight">,</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.4192em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述的是相邻单元 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6861em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span></span> 值的空间变化，不是对已经存成常数的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{\mathbf{E}}_k^V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.3643em;vertical-align:-0.247em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord overline"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8861em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.8061em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1173em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.339em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接求导。热应变中用于构造四点温度的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="bold">E</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{\mathbf{E}}_k^V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.3643em;vertical-align:-0.247em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord overline"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8861em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbf">E</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.8061em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="overline-line" style="border-bottom-width:0.04em;"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1173em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.339em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍按<a href="#section-26">第 7.2 节</a>使用。</p>
<h2 id="section-28">8. THM 离散方程、残差与一致切线</h2>
<p>本节采用前文的材料假设，先给出三场耦合系统，再分别说明需要光滑的项，以及直接按 T3 母单元或边界边计算的项。所有局部贡献均按<a href="#section-6">第 2.3 节</a>的节点组装规则形成全局量。</p>
<h3 id="section-34">8.1 整体残差与切线矩阵</h3>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">U</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol U,\boldsymbol P,\boldsymbol T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8805em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.11424em;">U</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">P</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为当前试算的节点位移、孔压和温度总值；<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">U</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\boldsymbol U,\Delta\boldsymbol P,\Delta\boldsymbol T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8805em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.11424em;">U</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">P</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是相对于上一个已收敛时间步的增量。时间离散采用 backward Euler，残差定义为方程左端减右端。<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol R_u,\boldsymbol R_p,\boldsymbol R_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.9722em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.00421em;">R</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.00421em;">R</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.00421em;">R</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3283em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为力学、流体质量和能量方程的残差向量：</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation="box"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">f</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">l</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">F</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">x</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">U</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">R</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mrow><mn>33</mn><mi>X</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo fence="true">[</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">K</mi><mrow><mn>33</mn><mi>G</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">f</mi><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo fence="true">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\boldsymbol R_u&amp;=\boldsymbol f_u^{\mathrm{skel}}-\bm{K}_{12}\boldsymbol P-\boldsymbol F_u^{\mathrm{ext}},\\
\boldsymbol R_p&amp;=\bm{K}_{21}\Delta\boldsymbol U+(\bm{K}_{22S}+\bm{S}_{\mathrm{PPP}})\Delta\boldsymbol P-\bm{K}_{23}\Delta\boldsymbol T
+\Delta t(\bm{K}_{22P}\boldsymbol P-\boldsymbol G_p)-\boldsymbol Q_p^{\mathrm{step}},\\
\boldsymbol R_T&amp;=\bm{K}_{33X}\Delta\boldsymbol T
+\Delta t\left[\bm{K}_{33G}\boldsymbol T+\boldsymbol f_T^{\mathrm{adv}}(\boldsymbol P,\boldsymbol T)\right]
-\boldsymbol Q_T^{\mathrm{step}}.
\end{aligned}
}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:5.9261em;vertical-align:-2.7131em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:3.2131em;"><span style="top:-7.9261em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:7.9261em;"></span><span class="boxpad"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:2.8731em;"><span style="top:-5.0896em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.00421em;">R</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">u</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top:-3.5601em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.00421em;">R</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2