<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator="true">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol Q_p^{\mathrm{step}},\boldsymbol Q_T^{\mathrm{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2946em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol">Q</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8696em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3831em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol">Q</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.9115em;"><span style="top:-2.4065em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.2935em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 采用 backward Euler 离散，分别对应代码中的 <code>dt*Load.Fp</code>、<code>dt*Load.FT</code>，即已组装的步末节点流体流入速率、传导热流入速率乘 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span></span></span></span>。本文域内源项为零，因此它们只包含边界贡献。对全局节点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07847em;">I</span></span></span></span>，其分量为</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation="box"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="false"><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mi>I</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><msub><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">Q</mi><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">e</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mi>I</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="true">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\left(\boldsymbol Q_p^{\mathrm{step}}\right)_I
&amp;=\Delta t\int_{\Gamma_q}N_I\overline q_{\mathrm{in}}\,2\pi r\,\mathrm ds,\\
\left(\boldsymbol Q_T^{\mathrm{step}}\right)_I
&amp;=\Delta t\int_{\Gamma_h}N_I\overline h_{\mathrm{in}}\,2\pi r\,\mathrm ds.
\end{aligned}
}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:6.1271em;vertical-align:-2.8135em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:3.3135em;"><span style="top:-8.1271em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:8.1271em;"></span><span class="boxpad"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:2.9735em;"><span style="top:-4.9735em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.36em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="minner"><span class="minner"><span class="mopen delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="delimsizing size1">(</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol">Q</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8696em;"><span style="top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span><span style="top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3831em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose delimcenter" style="top:0em;"><span class="delimsizing size1">)</span></span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.0455em;"><span style="top:-2.2672em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="h